---
import { CONTENT_SITE_URL } from '../../consts';
---

<section class="hub-feature-card mt-8">
  <span class="hub-badge hub-badge--neutral">HowLearn</span>
  <h2 class="type-subhead mt-3">학습 과학 콘텐츠</h2>
  <p class="type-caption chrome-muted mt-2">
    학부모 가이드, 수학 학습 칼럼, 학습 과학 개념은 HowLearn 콘텐츠 사이트에서 읽을 수 있습니다.
  </p>
  <ul class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-2 sm:flex-row sm:flex-wrap sm:gap-3">
    <li>
      <a
        href={`${CONTENT_SITE_URL}/guides`}
        class="type-caption font-medium text-indigo-600 hover:underline dark:text-indigo-400"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        학부모 가이드 →
      </a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a
        href={`${CONTENT_SITE_URL}/columns`}
        class="type-caption font-medium text-indigo-600 hover:underline dark:text-indigo-400"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        수학 학습 칼럼 →
      </a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a
        href={`${CONTENT_SITE_URL}/concepts`}
        class="type-caption font-medium text-indigo-600 hover:underline dark:text-indigo-400"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        학습 과학 개념 →
      </a>
    </li>
  </ul>
</section>
